%% Source: Flappy Bird AI README neuroevolution system overview.
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Flappy Bird AI neuroevolution loop
    accDescr: Each population plays until all birds die, then fitness scores drive selection, crossover, mutation, and elitism for the next generation.

    participant P as Population
    participant G as Game simulation
    participant F as Fitness
    participant E as Evolution

    loop Each generation
        E->>P: Spawn random or evolved brains
        loop Until all birds die
            P->>G: 5 inputs -> network -> flap
            G-->>P: Frame state + survival
        end
        G->>F: Final survival frames
        F->>E: Ranked fitness scores
        E->>E: Select top 5% distinct parents
        E->>E: Crossover + mutation
        E-->>P: Preserve elite and restart
    end
